cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its measurements, please cite it as below."
title: "RAPIDO reference implementation"
abstract: >-
  A measured, reproducible Rust reference implementation of the layered RAPIDO
  architecture for accountable anonymous authentication, together with mTLS,
  SCMS (explicit and implicit/ECQV) and Idemix-like CL-RSA baselines and a set
  of adversarial experiments. Every reported number is produced by running this
  code on a recorded machine, from a committed result file.
type: software
